  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "While the groups are heavily targeting individuals located in Iran, they’ve also compromised airlines and telecom providers in the Middle East region, possibly in an attempt to monitor targets’ movements and communications.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_3",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "One group, which we call Cadelle, uses Backdoor.Cadelspy, while the other, which we’ve named Chafer, uses Backdoor.Remexi and Backdoor.Remexi.B.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_5",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s2"
      },
      "text": "It’s unclear how Cadelle infects its targets with Backdoor.Cadelspy.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_6",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "However, Chafer has been observed compromising web servers, likely through SQL injection attacks, to drop Backdoor.Remexi onto victims’ computers.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_7",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s4"
      },
      "text": "In one instance, a computer was compromised with Backdoor.Cadelspy just minutes after being infected with Backdoor.Remexi.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_11",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s8"
      },
      "text": "The victims Data from Cadelle’s C&C servers shows that a large number of Backdoor.Cadelspy infections affected individual users of Iranian internet service providers (ISPs) and hosting services.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_18",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s1"
      },
      "text": "Additionally, Symantec observed that Backdoor.Cadelspy’s file strings seem to include dates written in the Solar Hijri calendar, which is used in Iran and Afghanistan.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_20",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s3"
      },
      "text": "Cadelle and Chafer are by no means the first Iran-based attack group to appear.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_21",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s4"
      },
      "text": "Other groups attributed to Iranian attackers, such as Rocket Kitten, have targeted Iranian individuals in the past, including anonymous proxy users, researchers, journalists, and dissidents.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_22",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s5"
      },
      "text": "Backdoor.Remexi activity in particular is reminiscent of Operation Cleaver, as documented by Cylance, and may possibly be a continuation of that activity.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_24",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s7"
      },
      "text": "Cadelle uses Backdoor.Cadelspy while Chafer operates with Backdoor.Remexi and Backdoor.Remexi.B.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_28",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Symantec_Iran-based-attackers-use-back-door-threats-to-spy-on-Middle-Eastern-targets(Dec-7-2015)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s11"
      },
      "text": "Remexi is a basic back door Trojan that allows attackers to open a remote shell on the computer and execute commands.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    }
